data: {"answer": "這裡是服務台附近的工單看板，顯示待處理的帳號、權限與密碼重設申請。系統採用 ITSM 來管理，並強調每個職務只給最少需要的權限。要注意電話社交工程的威脅，現場有來電身分核實等防護措施。", "go": [], "followups": [{"text": "IT 服務台系統（ITSM）是做什麼的？", "en": "What does the IT Service Desk (ITSM) do?", "zh": "IT 服務台系統（ITSM）是做什麼的？"}, {"text": "電話社交工程要怎麼防？", "en": "How do we prevent phone social engineering?", "zh": "電話社交工程要怎麼防？"}, {"text": "接下來要去哪？", "en": "What should I do next?", "zh": "接下來要去哪？"}], "trace": {"session": "offline", "lang": "zh", "model": "qwen3.5:9b", "timings": {"route_s": 0.0, "tool_s": 0.01, "answer_s": 6.79, "total_s": 6.81}, "route": {"tool": "room_overview", "target": "", "how": "button"}, "link": {"query": "(current room)", "chosen": "billiard_near", "how": "current room"}, "redirect": "", "queries": [{"purpose": "everything placed in this room", "cypher": "MATCH (r:Room {key:$k}) RETURN r {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh} AS r, [(r)-[:IN_AREA]->(a) | a {.key, .name_en, .name_zh}][0] AS area, [(r)-[:CLOSEUP_OF]->(p) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh}][0] AS parent, [(s:System)-[:LOCATED_IN]->(r) | s {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS systems, [(t:Threat)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | t {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS threats, [(c:Control)-[:SEEN_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .type}] AS controls, [(c:Concept)-[:TAUGHT_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS concepts, [(p:Procedure)-[:PRACTISED_IN]->(r) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .kind}] AS procedures, [(d:Department)-[:BASED_IN]->(r) | d {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .ext}] AS departments, [(cs:CaseStudy)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | cs {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .year}] AS cases, [(r)-[l:LINKS_TO]->(x) | x {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh, teleport: l.teleport}] AS exits, size([(f:Finding)-[:IN_ROOM]->(r) | f]) AS findings_here", "params": {"k": "billiard_near"}, "rows": 1, "ms": 6.3}], "graph": {"nodes": [{"key": "billiard_near", "label": "Room", "en": "IT Help Desk · Up Close", "zh": "服務台近看"}, {"key": "itsm", "label": "System", "en": "IT Service Desk (ITSM)", "zh": "IT 服務台系統（ITSM）"}, {"key": "vishing", "label": "Threat", "en": "Phone Social Engineering", "zh": "電話社交工程"}, {"key": "caller_verification", "label": "Control", "en": "Caller Identity Verification", "zh": "來電身分核實"}, {"key": "least_privilege", "label": "Control", "en": "Least Privilege & Role-Based Access", "zh": "最小權限與角色權限"}, {"key": "c_social_engineering", "label": "Concept", "en": "Social Engineering", "zh": "社交工程"}, {"key": "c_itsm", "label": "Concept", "en": "ITIL & IT Service Management", "zh": "ITIL 與 IT 服務管理"}], "edges": [{"a": "itsm", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "billiard_near"}, {"a": "vishing", "t": "TARGETS", "b": "itsm"}, {"a": "vishing", "t": "SHOWN_IN", "b": "billiard_near"}, {"a": "c_itsm", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "billiard_near"}, {"a": "c_itsm", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "itsm"}, {"a": "c_social_engineering", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "billiard_near"}, {"a": "c_social_engineering", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "vishing"}, {"a": "least_privilege", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "billiard_near"}, {"a": "caller_verification", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "billiard_near"}, {"a": "caller_verification", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "vishing"}]}, "tool_used": "room_overview", "facts": "房間：服務台近看・工單看板\n這裡講的是：工單看板列出待處理的申請：開帳號、改權限、重設密碼。\n重點：每個職務只給它需要的最少權限。\n這裡的系統：IT 服務台系統（ITSM）\n這裡要注意的威脅：電話社交工程\n看得到的防護措施：來電身分核實、最小權限與角色權限\n課程概念：社交工程、ITIL 與 IT 服務管理\n相關的處理流程：新進人員開帳號、密碼或驗證重設\n真實案例：MGM 渡假村網路攻擊（2023）\n這個房間藏著 1 個漏洞（讓玩家自己找，不要說出來）\n可以走到：資訊服務台", "answer_stats": {"model": "qwen3.5:9b", "wall_s": 6.79, "load_s": 0.0, "prompt_tokens": 693, "prompt_s": 2.49, "gen_tokens": 60, "gen_s": 4.28, "tok_per_s": 14.0, "first_token_s": 2.51}}, "state": {}}

